    "title": "Drury goes 0-2 in Thanksgiving Classic - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Pinson ,\n1 hours ago\nSPRINGFIELD, Mo–The Drury men were looking to bounce back from Tuesday night’s loss to Concordia.\nThe Panthers squaring off with Central Missouri.\nAnd Drury moving the ball, the dish to the corner and Avante Nichols drains the corner three, the Panthers down two.\nDrury went on a run, Keion Epps with the ally-oop to Nichols for the slam dunk, the Panthers were in front and that sparked a 13-0 run.\nDrury with the skip pass to Ethan Whatley, the senior from Ozark with a catch and shoot three, it’s 15-7 Panthers.\nBut Central Missouri owned the second half and wins 89-67.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KOLR - OzarksFirst.com.",
